# Frontend files

For a **new screen, layout pass, multi-component change, bug fix, or
refactor** in these files, read `.cursor/skills/inova-frontend/SKILL.md` and
the one reference you need (admin / mobile / react / clean-code / testing /
visual-qa).

For a typo, a single token, or a one-line style fix: skip the skill.

`AGENTS.md` and `docs/current.md` still win on scope and architecture.
